# API Layer — Controller & Endpoint Qaydaları

## Controller Şablonu

```csharp
[ApiController]
[Route("api/[controller]")]
public class OrdersController : ControllerBase
{
    private readonly IMediator _mediator;
    public OrdersController(IMediator mediator) => _mediator = mediator;

    // Cari autentifikasiya olunmuş user Id-si
    private Guid CurrentUserId =>
        Guid.Parse(User.FindFirstValue(ClaimTypes.NameIdentifier)!);
}
```

- `ControllerBase` — View yoxdur, `Controller` deyil.
- Constructor-da yalnız `IMediator`. Repository, service inject etmə.
- Business logic controller-dədir qəti olmaz.

## Endpoint Qaydaları

```csharp
// ✅ DÜZGÜN
[HttpPost]
[Authorize]
[ProducesResponseType(typeof(OrderDto), StatusCodes.Status201Created)]
[ProducesResponseType(StatusCodes.Status400BadRequest)]
[ProducesResponseType(StatusCodes.Status401Unauthorized)]
public async Task<ActionResult<OrderDto>> CreateOrder(
    [FromBody] CreateOrderRequest request, CancellationToken ct)
{
    var command = new CreateOrderCommand(CurrentUserId, request.Items,
        request.Address, request.DeliveryType, request.PaymentMethod, request.CouponCode);
    var result = await _mediator.Send(command, ct);
    return CreatedAtAction(nameof(GetOrder), new { id = result.Id }, result);
}
```

## HTTP Status Code-lar

| Vəziyyət | Status |
|---|---|
| Uğurlu yaratma | `201 Created` |
| Uğurlu oxuma/yeniləmə | `200 OK` |
| Uğurlu silmə | `204 No Content` |
| Tapılmadı | `404 Not Found` |
| Validation xətası | `400 Bad Request` |
| Autentifikasiya yoxdur | `401 Unauthorized` |
| İcazə yoxdur | `403 Forbidden` |

## Auth Atributu

```csharp
[Authorize]               // JWT tələb edir
[AllowAnonymous]          // Açıq endpoint
[Authorize(Roles = "Admin")] // Admin tələb edir
```

## Global Exception Middleware

```csharp
// Middleware/GlobalExceptionMiddleware.cs
public class GlobalExceptionMiddleware(RequestDelegate next, ILogger<GlobalExceptionMiddleware> logger)
{
    public async Task InvokeAsync(HttpContext ctx)
    {
        try { await next(ctx); }
        catch (ValidationException ex)
        {
            ctx.Response.StatusCode = 400;
            await ctx.Response.WriteAsJsonAsync(new
            {
                title = "Doğrulama xətası",
                status = 400,
                errors = ex.Errors.GroupBy(e => e.PropertyName)
                    .ToDictionary(g => g.Key, g => g.Select(e => e.ErrorMessage))
            });
        }
        catch (NotFoundException ex)
        {
            ctx.Response.StatusCode = 404;
            await ctx.Response.WriteAsJsonAsync(new { title = ex.Message, status = 404 });
        }
        catch (UnauthorizedException ex)
        {
            ctx.Response.StatusCode = 401;
            await ctx.Response.WriteAsJsonAsync(new { title = ex.Message, status = 401 });
        }
        catch (Exception ex)
        {
            logger.LogError(ex, "Gözlənilməz xəta");
            ctx.Response.StatusCode = 500;
            await ctx.Response.WriteAsJsonAsync(new { title = "Daxili server xətası", status = 500 });
        }
    }
}
```

## JWT Token Çıxarma

```csharp
// Extensions/ClaimsPrincipalExtensions.cs
public static class ClaimsPrincipalExtensions
{
    public static Guid GetUserId(this ClaimsPrincipal user) =>
        Guid.Parse(user.FindFirstValue(ClaimTypes.NameIdentifier)
            ?? throw new UnauthorizedException("Token etibarsızdır."));

    public static string GetUserRole(this ClaimsPrincipal user) =>
        user.FindFirstValue(ClaimTypes.Role) ?? UserRole.Customer.ToString();
}
```

## Endpoint URL Formatı

- Cəm ad: `/api/orders`, `/api/products`, `/api/addresses`
- Nested: `/api/products/{id}/reviews`
- Kebab-case: `/api/corporate/inquiry` (çoxheccalı)
- Query params: `/api/products?categorySlug=qizilguller&minPrice=10&page=1&pageSize=20`

## Pagination Response

```csharp
// Contracts/Common/PagedResult.cs
public record PagedResult<T>(
    IReadOnlyList<T> Items,
    int TotalCount,
    int Page,
    int PageSize)
{
    public int TotalPages => (int)Math.Ceiling(TotalCount / (double)PageSize);
    public bool HasNext => Page < TotalPages;
}
```
